      <activity id="e741e92d-bbd7-5095-842b-2025e4cc6e0b" activityNameId="2eceb042-329d-58ae-b4f4-fa800d65b4ca" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Carbon disulfide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Carbon disulfide, at plant
The process "acarbon disulfide, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  carbon disulfide from methane and sulphur in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000075-10-0; 
Formula: CS2; 
UUID: 7af62572-4847-3553-9615-1132b7fd76f2
Production of carbon disulfide including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world.
Technology: Sulphurization of methane
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7af62572-4847-3553-9615-1132b7fd76f2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
